atlas fixture-alpha
# A comment line, and a blank line follow.

architecture alpha
  canonical_name Alpha
  family substrate
  domain Fixture / Core
  layer core
  semantic_question What does alpha own?
  maturity measured
  owns FactA
  publishes FactB
  consumes FactC
  source_path architecture/alpha.yaff
  witness architecture/alpha.yaff proves itself
  witness a prose witness with no path
  cannot_infer alpha -> anything at all
  invariant alpha holds
  internal_calculus x = y
  mystery_key never read
  interacts alpha-to-beta

architecture beta
  canonical_name Beta
  family apps
  domain Fixture / Edge
  semantic_question Does beta consume?
  maturity implemented
  consumes FactA
  owns FactC
  subscribes FactD
  source_path cmd/Nope/missing.c
  known_gap the source moved to a native owner

view FixtureView
  expands_to alpha
  expands_to beta

view BadView
  expands_to alpha

interaction alpha-to-beta
  source alpha
  destination beta
  relation feeds
  preserves the fact
  drops nothing

interaction beta-to-alpha
  source beta
  destination alpha
  relation returns
